{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的 S05 只有 18 秒，却集中出现大量没有标注“到时出现”的感受短语，扫读负担明显高于 X；S13 对“听到对方承诺以后不变”的补充也略微改变了原本的叙事含义。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的关键词加亮让我不用逐字读完就能抓住每段发生了什么，话与感受交替排列、感受随乐句出现，也更适合一边听音乐一边扫屏。更重要的是，Y 不只是在描述人物情绪，还通过船、水、摇荡、失衡、靠岸等意象建立了贯穿全曲的感受线索，人物心理变化和音乐变化能够互相印证。它的细腻度和具体程度明显胜出，但个别段落存在感受短语堆积的问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "72b4d335-ab78-4151-984c-cb42de57b85e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002206447561Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:23:30.534862+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2e7c0a58032782eea32ba1322439ea2a3e7254773e4461dee60a4dbcd352e903", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat